get.description:
`q` searches titles, bodies and checklist text of THIS space only (never another space, so a Personal
note can't appear in Shared search). Case and Polish letters don't matter ("gdan" finds "Gdańsku");
every word must match as a word prefix. Up to 50 results, best match first.

post.description:
The only way a note changes space. Allowed: the Personal space's owner moving it into a Shared space they are
a member of. The response's `undo` says where and until when the same person may move it back (10 minutes);
moving it back returns `undo: null`. Emits `note.moved_out` in the old space and `note.moved_in` in the new one.
